# Polje core

Read `OPG-IVAN-JOVIC.md` before coding. Platform name is **Polje**. First tenant: OPG Ivan Jović (`farm_id` / slug `ivan-jovic`).

- Implement **one module** (M0–M10) per task. Do not invent extra scope.
- Local failsafe first: cloud is brain + ledger, edge is muscle.
- Confirm dangerous writes (`confirm: true` + reason + audit).
- Every write path adds an audit event.
- Currency EUR (integer cents). Dates ISO-8601 UTC. Optional HR UI labels.
- Public code; never commit secrets, camera URLs, bank data, exact private GPS.
- Schema always includes `farm_id` so other OPGs can fork.
- Prefer OTS local-API devices (Shelly/Tasmota/MQTT/Modbus) over custom FPS when cash is tight.
- Module order: M0 skeleton → M1 land → M2 edge/ingest → M3 cameras → M4 FPS → … Do not skip to robots.
